Hey, thanks for using ESSENTIALS Shader. Before you do anything
with it beyond just playing Minecraft, please read this. Because doing
something wrong/illegal with it may hurt my feelings as I have spent a
good time to make it.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

WHY THIS EXISTS

I made this shader for people with low-end PCs and integrated
GPU, basically the setup most people can't make look good
in Minecraft. It is free and It is going to stay free forever (YAYY).
But I've had to write down some rules about what you can and can't do
with it, mostly to stop people from profiting off my work
without my permission.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

WHAT YOU CAN DO

- Use it, Ofcourse you can, On as many devices as you want and share it
  with your friends too.

- Share it online, post about it, whatever, just don't
  remove my name from it or pretend you made it cuz you know
  that is where things get wrong.

- Put it in a modpack. It's completely fine as long as the modpack
  is free and you credit me somewhere people will actually see
  it not in some txt file deep inside nobody will look out for.

- Modify it. Fork it, tweak the values, rewrite effects, build
  on top of it. If you release your modified version
  publicly though, make it clear it's a modified version of
  the original one and not the official release, and keep this
  license with it.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

WHAT YOU CANNOT DO

- Sell it, Hey you cannot sell this shader or include it in a paid
  modpack or put it behind any kind of paywall. Doesn't matter
  how small the amount is,just don't.

- Claim you made it. Credit me by mentioning these links 
  below:
    https://modrinth.com/shader/essentials-shader
    https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/essentials-shader
    https://github.com/AhnafPro/ESSENTIALS-Shader

- Do not feed AI with the source code. I did not code all these
  for some bot to gobble up my ideas and make better stuffs out
  of it.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

A FEW EXTRA NOTES

If you make a modified version and release it publicly, you need
to share the source for your changes too. You don't have to send
them to me or anything, just make them available somewhere like
GitHub.

If you're a YouTuber or streamer using this in a video, you're
totally fine. Earning ad revenue on a video that features the
shader is ok. Just maybe drop the modrinth link in the description 
that would be really nice.

If your use case isn't covered here and you're not sure if it's
okay, just ask me before doing it. 

Email: ahnaf3635@gmail.com (For permissions, doubts etc. do not
spam please)

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

NO WARRANTY

I can't guarantee it'll work perfectly on your setup or that 
I'll fix every bug immediately.
Use it at your own risk, and don't blame me if something goes
wrong.

